{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 23, :comments ["<b>Everything that comes into fire.</b> One wonders why Israel was not commanded about gentile immersion-purification in the war against Sihon and Og as in the war against Midian. And one may answer: because the other wars were in the field and there were no household utensils there, but here, where the war was in Midian and they plundered the houses, they needed to be careful about gentile immersion-purification."], :book :numbers, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 31, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:10:23.761824498Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}